    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 427,
      "topLeftY": 284,
      "bottomRightX": 607,
      "bottomRightY": 319,
      "content": "The starter motor turns the engine. The piston moves up and down.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 426,
      "topLeftY": 333,
      "bottomRightX": 606,
      "bottomRightY": 415,
      "content": "Petrol and air are sucked in through the open inlet valve at the top of the cylinder. The air and petrol mixture is controlled by the carburettor.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 427,
      "topLeftY": 447,
      "bottomRightX": 581,
      "bottomRightY": 481,
      "content": "The cylinder is full of air and petrol.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 427,
      "topLeftY": 496,
      "bottomRightX": 557,
      "bottomRightY": 528,
      "content": "Air and petrol mixture is compressed.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 426,
      "topLeftY": 544,
      "bottomRightX": 594,
      "bottomRightY": 609,
      "content": "At the top of the cylinder is the spark plug. This provides the electric spark that ignites the mixture.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 427,
      "topLeftY": 625,
      "bottomRightX": 567,
      "bottomRightY": 643,
      "content": "The piston is forced down.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 426,
      "topLeftY": 658,
      "bottomRightX": 610,
      "bottomRightY": 691,
      "content": "The burnt mixture is pushed out of the exhaust valve.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 426,
      "topLeftY": 707,
      "bottomRightX": 613,
      "bottomRightY": 741,
      "content": "The inlet valve opens again and the cycle is repeated ...",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
